u001b[1m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236mC-b d\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Detach\u001b[49m\u001b[30m\u001b[1m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m-\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Less\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[3X\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[1m\r\nm\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Mode\u001b[49m\u001b[30m\u001b[1m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236mF8\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Layout\u001b[49m\u001b[30m\u001b[1m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236mo\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Options\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[10X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1;38H ▐▛███▜▌   Claude Code v2.1.220\u001b[39m\u001b[40X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[2;38H▝▜█████▛▘  Opus 5 (1M context) · API Usage Billing\u001b[39m\u001b[21X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[3;38H  ▘▘ ▝▝    /demo/railmux-web-workspace-v1/projects/railmux\u001b[39m\u001b[13X\u001b[4;38H\u001b[71X\u001b[38;5;147m\n❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;252mIn railmux ssh, explain how a mouse-wheel event over an agent pane\u001b[39m\u001b[3X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[6;38H  is served from the fast client's local history overlay rather than\u001b[39m\u001b[3X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[7;38H "]
[12.751843, "o", " forwarded upstream. Point to the exact implementation symbols and\u001b[39m\u001b[4X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[8;38H  one existing focused test that directly asserts empty\u001b[39m\u001b[16X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[9;38H  forwarded_input. Then suggest one small additional assertion.\u001b[39m\u001b[8X\u001b[10;38H\u001b[71X\u001b[38;5;147m\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1mTrace SSH wheel ownership\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[44X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[12;38H  \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252mrailmux ssh — agent-pane wheel served locally, not forwarded\u001b[39m\u001b[9X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[13;38H  upstream:\u001b[39m\u001b[60X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[14;38H  1. handle_terminal_part gets the SgrMouseEvent and dispatches to\u001b[39m\u001b[5X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[15;38H  LocalHistoryView.wheel.\u001b[39m\u001b[46X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[16;38H  2. wheel() resolves the pane via _route_at; a hit on an agent\u001b[39m\u001b[8X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[17;38H  viewport scrolls _HistoryViewport.offset and returns HistoryAction\u001b[39m\u001b[3X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[18;38H  with render_history=True and forwarded_input=b\"\" — no upstream\u001b[39m\u001b[7X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[19;38H  input.\u001b[39m\u001b[63X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[20;38H  3. apply_history_action only sends upstream when\u001b[39m\u001b[21X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[21;38H  action.forwarded_input is set; empty means nothing reaches tmux. The\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[22;38H  overlay is painted client-side via surface.paint_overlays.\u001b[39m\u001b[11X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[23;38H  4. This is a fast-client history overlay over bounded snapshots, not\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[24;38H  tmux copy-mode; the implementation notes stock tmux WheelUpPane\u001b[39m\u001b[6X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[25;38H  would enter copy-mode, which is deliberately avoided.\u001b[39m\u001b[16X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[26;38H  Focused test: tests/test_fast_full_window.py::test_local_history_rou\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[27;38H  tes_sidebar_immediately_and_owns_agent_wheel asserts\u001b[39m\u001b[17X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[28;38H  agent_action.forwarded_input == b\"\".\u001b[39m\u001b[33X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[29;38H  Suggested addition: assert agent_action.render_history is True,\u001b[39m\u001b[6X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[30;38H  proving the overlay rendered rather than merely dropping the event.\u001b[39m\u001b[2X\u001b[31;38H\u001b[71X\n\u001b[71X\n\u001b[71X\u001b[38;5;239m\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;147m\u001b[35;38H❯\u001b[39m \u001b[69X\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[36;38H──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[37;38H  ⏵⏵ normal mode · shift+tab to cycle · ← for agents\u001b[39m\u001b[19X\u001b[1;110H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n                          \u001b[38;5;70m\u001b[1mRAILMUX  ·  PANE 2\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[18;110H                        \u001b[37m\u001b[1mReady for another agent\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[19;110H                                   \u001b[K\u001b[20;110H                      \u001b[38;5;244mChoose a session in Railmux\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[21;110H                \u001b[38;5;244mclick / ␣  show    ·    ↵  open & focus\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[22;110H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[30m\u001b[48;5;70m\r\n Railmux · Codex · ◧                                                                                                 Soft Quit (q, then s) closes shared views; agents keep running \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[24;36H"]
